Lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Peach Spritzer<\/h3><h4>Ingredients<\/h4><ul><li>50ml <em>Peach<\/em><\/li><li>100ml Prosecco<\/li><li>Lemonade or Soda Water<\/li><\/ul><h4>Recipe<\/h4><ol><li>Fill a glass with ice and add <em>Peach<\/em>. <\/li><li>Pour in prosecco and top up with lemonade\/soda water (depending on your taste).<\/li><li>Stir and garnish with peach or orange slices.<\/li><li>Serve and enjoy!<\/li><\/ol>","page":""}},"32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>Shipping for orders under £40<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>Shipping for orders £40-£70<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97","caption","price","variant_picker"